# portage's own resolver cases (lib/portage/tests/resolver/test_depclean*.py) as VDB test packages,
# the expected clean lists are the values portage exposes, then the qmerge side:
# abort on an empty @world, -v reasons, --with-bdeps, real removal with
# post-success state, deselect, the lib check and the listing byte for byte.
# The vdb is snapshotted and restored around the family.
